{
  "dom_id": "step-135391",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying a Missing Number",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14130839/assets/23940bc011c6cd71c0d9d58b4bab0b175722a21fd1c80062ed5cb5ceff3729c0.png)\n\nWhat number is missing from the multiplication problem above?",
  "worked_solution": "We have $\\dfrac{3}{4}$ on the left and $\\dfrac{9}{20}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14130839/assets/31badccda3cc3548e2bdc40158e88d32feddcf92b8fdd4d4ae18f08396ca8cfc.png)\n\nThe shape on the right-hand side is split into $5$ equal parts by horizontal lines.\nSo, the shaded part on the right is $\\dfrac{\\color{blue}3}{5}$ of the shaded part on the left. \n\nTherefore, the multiplication problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{3}{4} \\times \\dfrac{\\color{blue}3}{5} = \\dfrac{9}{20}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $\\color{blue}3.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-135391\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"135391\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14523\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-135391\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">Identifying a Missing Number</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"135391\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <div id=\"graphic-19cd0e18fac2630a47c7bae13f89c3ea\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/19cd0e18fac2630a47c7bae13f89c3ea\"></div>\n\n<p>What number is missing from the multiplication problem above?</p>\n\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n             